      "refersTo": "button-white",
      "description": "正文和蓝色扩展区的矩形主行动；首屏另覆盖为 44px 最小高度、10px 20px 内边距和 13px 字号。",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-button-white\" href=\"#start\">开始使用 <svg class=\"ds-arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a>",
      "css": ".ds-button-white{font-family:var(--font,Satoshi,\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif);display:inline-flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:28px;min-height:50px;padding:0 23px;border-radius:4px;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;background:#edf1f4;color:#101315;text-decoration:none;transition:background .2s,transform .25s var(--ease,cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1))}.ds-button-white:hover{background:#dce7ff;transform:translateY(-3px)}.ds-button-white:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #78a0ff;outline-offset:5px;}.ds-arrow{width:20px;height:20px;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.6}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-button-white{transition:none}.ds-button-white:hover{transform:none}}"
