      "refersTo": "nav-action",
      "description": "提取固定导航的可复用样式；定位和手机开合留在官网布局及 app.js。",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"导航样式示例\"><a href=\"#workflow\">工作方式</a><a href=\"#memory\">长期记忆</a><a class=\"ds-nav-action\" href=\"#start\">开始使用 <svg class=\"ds-external\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12\"/></svg></a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{font-family:var(--font,Satoshi,\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif);display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:34px;font-size:14px;background:linear-gradient(#030916 12%,#030916e0 65%,#03091600);color:#edf1f4;padding:18px}.ds-nav a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none;transition:color .2s,background .2s}.ds-nav a:hover{color:#a5bfff}.ds-nav a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #78a0ff;outline-offset:5px;}.ds-nav .ds-nav-action{padding:11px 17px;border:1px solid #59636e;display:flex;gap:25px;align-items:center;border-radius:4px}.ds-nav .ds-nav-action:hover{background:#edf1f4;color:#101315}.ds-external{width:18px;height:18px;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.5}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-nav a{transition:none}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "记忆节点",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "memory-node",
      "description": "默认深钢灰，选中浅蓝底深色字；图标使用当前项目节点描边 SVG。",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-memory-node\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><svg class=\"ds-node-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 7V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h5l3 4h6a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v10a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V7Z\"/></svg><span>项目背景</span></button>",
      "css": ".ds-memory-node{font-family:var(--font,Satoshi,\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif);display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;background:#25313c;color:var(--ink,#eef5ff);min-height:52px;padding:10px 17px;border:0;border-radius:9px;font-size:13px;box-shadow:0 8px 24px #0002;cursor:pointer;transition:color .2s,background .2s,transform .25s var(--ease,cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1))}.ds-memory-node:hover{transform:translateY(-4px)}.ds-memory-node[aria-pressed=\"true\"]{background:var(--blue,#aac9ff);color:#101828}.ds-memory-node:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #78a0ff;outline-offset:5px;}.ds-node-icon{width:19px;height:19px;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.5;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-memory-node{transition:none}.ds-memory-node:hover{transform:none}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "记忆分类标签",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "memory-tag",
      "description": "静态分类信息，不承担筛选或操作。",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-note-tags\"><span>用户偏好</span><span>输出格式</span></div>",
      "css": ".ds-note-tags{font-family:var(--font,Satoshi,\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif);display:flex;gap:8px}.ds-note-tags span{font-size:12px;padding:5px 9px;background:var(--soft,#0c1524);border-radius:5px;color:#a5bfff}"
    },
    {
      "name": "记忆正文",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "memory-note",
      "description": "无阴影的暗色阅读卡；显示正文与来源，样本内容与官网一致。",
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-memory-note\"><div class=\"ds-note-top\"><span>Wiki / 输出偏好</span><span>记忆示意</span></div><h3>先给结论，再讲依据。</h3><p>你偏好简洁的中文摘要：先说明结论，再列出依据与待办。后续任务可以检索这条偏好，减少重复交代。</p><div class=\"ds-note-source\"><span>来源可追溯</span><p>关联到提出这项偏好的原始对话</p></div></article>",
      "css": ".ds-memory-note{font-family:var(--font,Satoshi,\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif);padding:28px 32px;background:#202930;color:var(--ink,#eef5ff);border-radius:var(--radius,12px);min-height:380px}.ds-note-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;color:var(--muted,#aebfd4);font-size:12px;padding-bottom:28px}.ds-memory-note h3{font-size:23px;line-height:1.5;margin:0 0 18px;font-weight:700}.ds-memory-note>p{margin:0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.85;color:var(--muted,#aebfd4);min-height:78px}.ds-note-source{margin-top:24px;padding-top:19px;border-top:1px solid var(--line,#30425c);font-size:12px}.ds-note-source>span{color:var(--blue,#aac9ff);font-weight:700}.ds-note-source p{font-size:12px;line-height:1.85;color:var(--muted,#aebfd4);margin:5px 0 0}"
    },
    {
      "name": "终端与复制控件",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "terminal",
      "description": "代码容器内部滚动；样本展示外观，复制反馈由官网脚本提供。",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-terminal\"><div class=\"ds-terminal-head\"><span>启动 Web 工作台</span><button class=\"ds-copy\" aria-label=\"复制启动命令样式示例\">复制</button></div><pre><code>uv run qrclaw serve</code></pre></div>",
      "css": ".ds-terminal{font-family:var(--font,Satoshi,\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif);background:#141c24;color:#dae7ff;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;min-width:0}.ds-terminal-head{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:15px;padding:7px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid #ffffff1a;min-height:43px;font-size:12px;color:#aabbd9}.ds-terminal pre{margin:0;padding:22px 23px;overflow:auto;line-height:1.9;color:#e0eaff}.ds-terminal code{font-family:\"SFMono-Regular\",Consolas,\"Liberation Mono\",monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:1.9;tab-size:2}.ds-copy{font-family:var(--font,Satoshi,\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif);font-size:12px;color:#c8d8f6;padding:8px;min-height:36px;margin-right:-6px;border:0;background:none;border-radius:5px;cursor:pointer;transition:color .2s,background .2s}.ds-copy:hover{background:#ffffff15;color:white}.ds-copy:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #78a0ff;outline-offset:5px;}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-copy{transition:none}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "工作原理阶段入口",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "phase-control",
      "description": "冰蓝下划线与 aria-pressed 表达选中，完整行为使用统一滚动坐标。",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-phase-context\"><button class=\"ds-phase\" aria-pressed=\"true\"><span class=\"ds-step-number\">02</span><span>拆解</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-phase-context{background:#030916;padding:16px}.ds-phase{font-family:var(--font,Satoshi,\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif);position:relative;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;color:#a2b0bc;font-size:14px;padding:13px 0;min-height:44px;min-width:140px;text-align:left;border:0;background:none;cursor:pointer;transition:color .2s}.ds-step-number{font-size:12px;color:#80909f;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-phase[aria-pressed=\"true\"]{color:#fff}.ds-phase[aria-pressed=\"true\"] .ds-step-number{color:#c2dfff}.ds-phase i{position:absolute;height:2px;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;background:#b6dcff;transform:scaleX(0);transform-origin:left;transition:transform .45s var(--ease,cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1))}.ds-phase[aria-pressed=\"true\"] i{transform:scaleX(1)}.ds-phase:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #78a0ff;outline-offset:5px;}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-phase,.ds-phase i{transition:none}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "冷蓝玻璃暗棚",
    "overview": "深蓝暗场承托 AH 的真实 Human Brain 模型。自然褶皱、冰蓝透射和窄条反射构成体积；固定模型与连续相机把完整轮廓、侧面和近景连接起来，最后让真实工作台接过叙事。\n\n中文标题、明确的行动入口与四阶段定位保持可读。正文保留既有产品回放、记忆、扩展和安装组件，仅共享更新后的暗蓝基础色；真实截图保留产品自身外观。",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "深蓝暗场、冰蓝玻璃、受控反射与白色文字。",
      "同一个固定模型、连续镜头、四阶段自然滚动。",
      "QRDisplay 中文标题、Satoshi 品牌与正文、等宽代码。",
      "矩形行动、细线导航、真实截图和可追溯模型署名。",
      "暂停与减少动态模式保留章节阅读和静态关键镜头。"
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The 状态可读 Rule",
        "body": "阶段与选中状态同时保留文字、下划线和可访问语义。",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The 标题子集 Rule",
        "body": "新增中文标题时复核并更新 QRDisplay 子集。",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Dark Refraction Rule",
        "body": "透射背景必须存在于 WebGL 场景内，CSS 暗底不能代替玻璃采样背景。",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "**Do** 保留 AH 原始几何、冷蓝玻璃层次与可见署名。",
      "**Do** 保持场景与相机的 900px compact 分支一致，并保留独立窄屏镜头。",
      "**Do** 以精确滚动状态控制阅读，以平滑进度控制相机与交接。",
      "**Do** 保留键盘、暂停、减少动态与真实模型静帧降级。",
      "**Do** 区分工作原理示意、真实截图、实际运行状态与本地性能样本。"
    ],
    "donts": [
      "**Don't** 用旧 Q 几何或旋转环替代已确认的真实大脑。",
      "**Don't** 将模型旋转、指针偏移或额外装饰重新加入这条相机叙事。",
      "**Don't** 把材质色、派生色带或被覆盖的 CSS 旧值当成主题真源。",
      "**Don't** 将官网视觉规范覆盖到根目录产品工作台。",
      "**Don't** 将本地手机尺寸视口数据写成手机真机或线上性能保证。"
    ]
  }
}
